# Lending from Items > Loans through the item prompt and its pick list:
# item 1 lent by its ID, all of it; text typed lists the items that can
# be lent holding it, with help over the list; Esc goes back to the
# prompt, its title and text kept; nothing typed lists every item that
# can be lent, item 1 left out; text no item holds lists none; Esc from
# the prompt gives back the list's hints and help topic; and an item
# chosen from the pick list opens the loan form.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T O
K INS ENTER
T 1
K ENTER TAB
T Ann Lee
K TAB TAB TAB
T 2026-11-01
K CTRL-S
S LENTONE
K INS ENTER
T tan
S ASKLEND
K ENTER
S PICKLEND
K F1
S PICKHLP
K ESC ESC
S ASKBACK
K CTRL-Y ENTER
S PICKALL
K ESC CTRL-Y
T zzz
K ENTER
S PICKNONE
K ESC ESC
S LISTBACK
K F1
S LISTHLP
K ESC INS ENTER ENTER DOWN ENTER
S LENDFORM
K ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
